unty&rsquo;s 6 grids in Wayne County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those 75 years. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, March to April ran 164% of normal and November to December just 45%. Every grid had its driest year in 1953, with grid 22367 at 61%. A preliminary estimate for grid 22066 puts August to September 2026 at 66.3.</p>"}
